  "title": "Corn on the Cob (Easy Cleaning and Shucking)",
  "description": "This easy method for shucked corn replaces husking and silking with a quick heat in the microwave to squeeze the ear of corn out of its husk easily.",
  "authors": [
    "CCARR48"
  ],
  "date_published": "2018-06-08T10:02:49-04:00",
